[en.DECISION_C02_SECOND_ELECTION]
The Second Ponyville Duchess Election

[en.DECISION_C02_SECOND_ELECTION_desc]
Empress Gozy Glow has been displeased with Duchess Trixie for a long time, but she does not want to directly intervene in Ponyville, so as not to arouse panic in other fiefdoms. However, fortunately... or unfortunately, Empress Gozy Glow found a loophole in the nominal election decree drafted at the time.
This means that, after Trixie has served for 4 years, Empress Gozy Glow has the power to hold a new election in Ponyville to decide whether Duchess Trixie can continue to rule. And now, many politicians are active in Ponyville, and many of them have their own political posititons and hope to become the next Duchess.
So, welcome to politics!

[en.DECISION_C02_SECOND_ELECTION_TRIGGER_TOOLTIP]
Trixie gain the absolute trust of Empress Gozy Glow, or... transcend past it all.

[en.DECISION_C02_SECOND_ELECTION_EFFECT_TOOLTIP]
Hold §YThe Second Ponyville Election§!.

[zh.DECISION_C02_SECOND_ELECTION]
第二届小马谷领主选举

[zh.DECISION_C02_SECOND_ELECTION_desc]
和煦光流女皇对特丽克西领主早已不满，但她并不希望直接干预小马谷，从而激起其他封地的恐慌。但幸运的是... 或许说不幸的是，和煦光流女皇在当时起草的名义性选举法令中，找到了一个可以利用的漏洞。
这意味着，特丽克西就任4年后，和煦光流有权力在小马谷举行一场新的领主选举，以决定特丽克西领主是否可以连任。而如今活跃在小马谷的政治家们，不少都有着自己的政治主张，并希望能够成为下一任公爵。
因此，欢迎来到政治！

[zh.DECISION_C02_SECOND_ELECTION_TRIGGER_TOOLTIP]
特丽克西取得和煦女皇的绝对信任，或者...超越这一切。

[zh.DECISION_C02_SECOND_ELECTION_EFFECT_TOOLTIP]
举行§Y第二届小马谷大选§!。
